  "notes": [
   "A part number reads ERJ (thick film chip resistor), then the size code PA2, PA3, P03, P06, P08, PM8 or P14, then the tolerance code D (±0.5 %), F (±1 %) or J (±5 %), then the nominal value, then the packaging code. Example: ERJP06D1002V (twelve places; a ±5 % part has eleven).",
